<title>SWEDEN: Skandia up on Handelsbanken/Stadshypotek.</title>
<headline>Skandia up on Handelsbanken/Stadshypotek.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Skandia rose on the Stockholm bourse on Thursday afternoon after Handelsbanken announced it was holding a news conference concerning mortgage bank Stadshypotek.</p>
<p>At 1340 GMT Skandia was trading at 189.5 crowns which was 5.5 crowns higher than before the announcement which prompted trading in the two banks to be suspended.</p>
<p>Skandia and Stadshypotek late last month announced a proposed merger which received strong criticism from the government that controls the state's 34 percent holding in Stadshypotek.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
